Phase 2 of docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-30-canlin-android-adapter-design.md §6.2: power (battery), screen (keep awake, brightness via window attribute), net status, Wi-Fi scan/connect/forget, open Android settings. JNI from the owner thread, bounded per call, no BroadcastReceiver (bounded polling on a core timer instead). Hostile-module review: Lua sees only canlin.sys battery level/charging and online/offline; SSIDs/scan lists and Wi-Fi config only in trusted settings. canlin-os implements the same interface later (sysfs, wpa_supplicant).
